Calculate the average cost per city, and calculate the overall average cost of all entries as a fallback.
Save a dictionary {"city_costs": {city_name: avg_cost}, "overall_average": avg_val} to a JSON or pickle file (e.g. city_cost_lookup.json).
[MODIFY] 
predict_cost.py
